ate} {:db/id "13ef16eb-1657-5324-8294-4449e71c4000" :answer/id #uuid "13ef16eb-1657-5324-8294-4449e71c4000" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/95/9560b790b63b75ce1a0e79e0beb58e0f51693723fdc8ac0642440fd4ad973937.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "37e994b8-8c59-5ccf-a6e4-81eeb22d9cfe" :answer/id #uuid "37e994b8-8c59-5ccf-a6e4-81eeb22d9cfe" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/4e/4e79f6a378556f500223baaa090df75b002cfd83196bd23b748278ef542b0fae.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0d9748db-ff33-5738-9275-47347081811f" :answer/id #uuid "0d9748db-ff33-5738-9275-47347081811f" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/a5/a5ee72ae329a50484d2d6c41983fbcf131500e9f52619d1c6644a63a10e9b92f.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "922e2ffe-74c1-5bcd-bceb-cbe86b8efa17" :answer/id #uuid "922e2ffe-74c1-5bcd-bceb-cbe86b8efa17" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/76/76268ad669c8974c2e342d00c31d0545caa1f8d86001b4e30c4142ff7ac6df23.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "48cb5210-6b6f-502e-b04b-51371c35d32a" :answer-field/id #uuid "48cb5210-6b6f-502e-b04b-51371c35d32a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["890ee44e-76ba-5143-a748-348d04ac2127" "13ef16eb-1657-5324-8294-4449e71c4000" "37e994b8-8c59-5ccf-a6e4-81eeb22d9cfe" "0d9748db-ff33-5738-9275-47347081811f" "922e2ffe-74c1-5bcd-bceb-cbe86b8efa17"] :answer-field/correct "890ee44e-76ba-5143-a748-348d04ac2127" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "b43bc1bc-dcf4-5470-9387-8faf0f4ffb56" :question/id #uuid "b43bc1bc-dcf4-5470-9387-8faf0f4ffb56" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $F(x,y)=2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j$ at the indicated points?" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-2,\\frac{7}{4}),(1,- \\frac{1}{4}),$ and $(-1,\\frac{7}{4}).$\n\nTo sketch the vector field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the function $F(x,y)=2 x y\\,i-x^{2}\\,j\\,:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(-2,\\frac{7}{4}) & =\\left((2)(-2)(\\frac{7}{4})\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-7\\,i-4\\,j \\\\ F(1,- \\frac{1}{4}) & =\\left((2)(1)(- \\frac{1}{4})\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(1)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-\\frac{1}{2}\\,i-j \\\\ F(-1,\\frac{7}{4}) & =\\left((2)(-1)(\\frac{7}{4})\\right)\\,i+\\left((-1)(-1)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-\\frac{7}{2}\\,i-j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/2b/2b09ff0226023ff4dc3dc2f8f50f3e0a7882111a64fd4170dafba4f43082d380.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["48cb5210-6b6f-502e-b04b-51371c35d32a"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "f98bd55b-3400-51be-83c0-e4bec78eed02" :answer/id #uuid "f98bd55b-3400-51be-83c0-e4bec78eed02" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/91/91f6b076c94322c828a689829eaab50cda96b38237e21ed6d3010ae49ef89dfc.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f7236076-70c6-51ad-8f1c-70ee14c70552" :answer/id #uuid "f7236076-70c6-51ad-8f1c-70ee14c70552" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/b6/b6f5ce40a52995b6b4cda770566885cfbfdc3f74cfade2d37f2bc88f6e55c6e4.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e6c20b29-76d4-5e38-8c58-494a801735b7" :answer/id #uuid "e6c20b29-76d4-5e38-8c58-494a801735b7" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/ac/ac7b6358e4a38abf76e49ca6e45dd3f170dd0565e4f303fd0ba4404c277ed2ab.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8b187716-5c52-5154-8eba-92ea2595ebca" :answer/id #uuid "8b187716-5c52-5154-8eba-92ea2595ebca" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/a6/a69a9afddf3271e21e7b0a4136a84d4420238af354869085c58d931ac2e045fe.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fda4634f-2172-562a-acac-47e97dcdd3ed" :answer/id #uuid "fda4634f-2172-562a-acac-47e97dcdd3ed" :answer